						"description":"AR3DMat Black Basalt Slate Stone is a fully customizable procedural texture that replicates the natural look of black basalt slate stone. It features adjustable parameters for stone detail, roughness, rotation, and shift, making it perfect for walls, floors, and exterior surfaces. Designed for both Cycles and Eevee, this material delivers realistic results without relying on image textures, ensuring flexibility and high-quality performance for any 3D project.",
